{
  "sourceCommit": "5f8f337f6c1fb0d330d0f20ff3b9a9b948feb54c",
  "html": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://mage-os.org\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\".github/assets/mage-os-logo.png\" alt=\"Mage-OS\" width=\"120\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 align=\"center\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Mage-OS agent skills</h1><a id=\"user-content-mage-os-agent-skills\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Mage-OS agent skills\" href=\"#mage-os-agent-skills\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AI agent skills for Magento and Mage-OS: modules, stores, themes and\neverything in between. Works with Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor,\nGitHub Copilot, OpenCode and other tools that support the open\n<a href=\"https://agentskills.io\" rel=\"nofollow\">Agent Skills</a> standard.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Skills</h2><a id=\"user-content-skills\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Skills\" href=\"#skills\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Skill</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"plugins/module-standards/README.md\"><strong>module-standards</strong></a></td>\n<td>Audits a Magento or Mage-OS module against the Mage-OS extension standards (CI, PHPStan, PHPCS, tests, admin UX, security, documentation) and brings it up to that level, one area at a time.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">More skills are on the way. Have an idea for one? See\n<a href=\"#contributing\">Contributing</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Wishlist</h2><a id=\"user-content-wishlist\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Wishlist\" href=\"#wishlist\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Skills we'd love to see. Want to build one? Say so in the\n<a href=\"https://mage-os.org/discord-channel/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mage-OS Discord</a> so work doesn't\noverlap, then open a pull request.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Skill</th>\n<th>What it would do</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>mage-os-migration</strong></td>\n<td>Move a store from Magento Open Source to Mage-OS: composer changes, a compatibility report for installed extensions, patches and a test plan.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>store-upgrade</strong></td>\n<td>Plan and carry out a Magento or Mage-OS version upgrade: risky extensions, overridden templates, conflicting plugins and preferences, and a test checklist.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>extension-vetting</strong></td>\n<td>Assess a third-party extension before installing it: code quality, callhome code, security, and conflicts with the extensions already installed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>store-performance</strong></td>\n<td>Find what slows a store down: full page cache blockers, indexer and cron setup, Redis and OpenSearch configuration, heavy layout handles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>store-security</strong></td>\n<td>Check a store's security: missing patches, <code>composer audit</code> across all dependencies, admin hardening, exposed files, CSP mode, secrets committed to git.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Claude Code</h3><a id=\"user-content-claude-code\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Claude Code\" href=\"#claude-code\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add this repository as a plugin marketplace once:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/plugin marketplace add mage-os-lab/agent-skills\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>/plugin marketplace add mage-os-lab/agent-skills\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Then install the skills you want:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/plugin install module-standards@mage-os\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>/plugin install module-standards@mage-os\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update with <code>/plugin marketplace update mage-os</code>, or turn on auto-update\nunder <code>/plugin</code> &gt; Marketplaces &gt; mage-os.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Other tools</h3><a id=\"user-content-other-tools\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Other tools\" href=\"#other-tools\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Every skill lives in <code>plugins/&lt;name&gt;/skills/&lt;name&gt;/</code> and works in any tool\nthat supports Agent Skills. Install one with the cross-tool installer:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx skills add https://github.com/mage-os-lab/agent-skills/tree/main/plugins/&lt;name&gt;/skills/&lt;name&gt; -g\"><pre>npx skills add https://github.com/mage-os-lab/agent-skills/tree/main/plugins/<span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>name<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span>/skills/<span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>name<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span> -g</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">or copy the folder to <code>~/.agents/skills/</code>, which Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor,\nGitHub Copilot and OpenCode all read. Each skill's README has the exact\ncommands, including how to upload it to Claude.ai.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Contributing</h2><a id=\"user-content-contributing\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contributing\" href=\"#contributing\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Contributions are welcome, from fixing a typo in a rule to adding a whole\nnew skill.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Change a rule.</strong> The standards a skill applies are written down in its\n<code>references/</code> folder. Open a pull request against the file; the\ndiscussion happens there.</li>\n<li><strong>Add a skill.</strong> Follow the structure of an existing skill in\n<code>plugins/</code>, add the plugin to <code>.claude-plugin/marketplace.json</code>, and add a\nrow to the Skills table.\nKeep skills tool-neutral: plain instructions, no features that only one\nagent supports.</li>\n<li><strong>Test it.</strong> Run the skill on a few real modules or stores before opening\nthe pull request, and mention what you tried.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Not sure where to start? Ask in the\n<a href=\"https://mage-os.org/discord-channel/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mage-OS Discord</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Dual licensed under the <a href=\"LICENSE.txt\">Open Software License 3.0</a> and the\n<a href=\"LICENSE_AFL.txt\">Academic Free License 3.0</a>, the same licenses as Magento\nand Mage-OS.</p>\n</article></div>"
}
